# DEBUG-RSI 11-02（总调度 fredw-2b 批，K-OPS-E07）：gpu36 ComfyUI 日志轮转；copytruncate = 不重启 ComfyUI、不打断作业
/root/work/fredw/comfy/logs/gpu0.log /root/work/fredw/comfy/logs/gpu1.log /root/work/fredw/longshot/logs/lane.log {
    size 50M
    rotate 7
    compress
    delaycompress
    missingok
    notifempty
    copytruncate
}
